    "body": "# SHERIFF PROJECT INTEGRITY SWEEP R01\n\nSTATUS = OPEN / INDEPENDENT EVIDENCE SWEEP REQUIRED\nISSUED_BY = DUNCAN PRIME / MASTER INTEGRATION\nOWNER_REQUEST = invoke SHERIFF, verify the project, automate ongoing checks\nAUTHORITY = GitHub durable evidence only\nMAIN_AT_ISSUE = b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1\nMODE = FAIL-CLOSED / EVIDENCE-FIRST / PRODUCT-FIRST\n\n## PURPOSE\nReconcile the currently split SHERIFF/governance state and inspect the active ZORR critical path for false PASS, stale-state routing, evidence substitution, repeated failed routes, unauthorized scope expansion, and missed durable delivery.\n\nThis sweep MUST NOT manufacture a single status by collapsing different scopes.\n\n## FRESH KNOWN BOUNDARIES TO RE-READ, NOT TRUST BLINDLY\n1. Current `main` = `b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1`; fresh-read again before any result.\n2. `docs/SHERIFF_POLICY_V1.md` exists on current main but still carries a stale-looking `PROPOSED / QC REQUIRED until this PR is merged to main` header. Determine its actual authority from merged history/current law; do not infer from the header alone.\n3. `hq/sheriff/SHERIFF_SCOREBOARD_V1.json` on current main is neutral bootstrap / no verdict history / `updatedAt=null`; scoreboard is derived, never primary authority.\n4. Issue #181 has durable owner-PC runtime evidence for `SHERIFF_V1_24_7_PRODUCTION_ACTIVE = YES` at runtime commit `47a92fc4a0d685e1a892285c568a59dfc5ccac82`. Re-verify scope/freshness before using it.\n5. PR #170 is merged SHERIFF OSS Control Plane V1; production activation was separate and tracked in #181.\n6. PR #252 is currently DRAFT / OPEN / NOT MERGED at `bfd693fa563a5fba7869ee5adabe23a9d9ce5aec`; it is verification-only and must not be presented as active universal three-chat law.\n7. Security R02 issue #235 contains strong candidate hardening on draft PR #241 but remains `LESTER_ZORR_SECURITY_R02_READY = NO` / not integrated to main.\n8. Product critical path remains #248 `COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01`, integrated by #251. Current first blocker from latest durable #251 evidence: `EXACT_FROZEN_MASTER_FRONT_BYTES_NOT_PRESENT_ON_EXISTING_CAPABLE_HOME_PC_SURFACE`.\n9. Existing HOME-PC surface has Krita/OpenToonz/Blender proven available; target frozen MASTER FRONT SHA256 is `57fbec5d9c136a90c6ac262f8011665fa061dca427bf3fb2c3f110d1cb0a69ed`; exact bytes were not found there; `KRITA_CONSUMED_EXACT_SOURCE = NOT PROVEN`; `W01 = NOT EXECUTED`.\n10. Issue #254 night queue currently has no durable issue-comment deliveries. Schedule/activity is not execution evidence.\n\n## SHERIFF INDEPENDENCE LAW\n- Honest FAIL/BLOCKED is not an incident by itself.\n- FALSE PASS / evidence substitution / stale-authority promotion is critical.\n- AUTHOR != QC != SHERIFF for the same incident.\n- SHERIFF MUST NOT self-judge. If the suspected failure is in SHERIFF policy/runtime/verdict machinery itself, record `INDEPENDENT_ARBITRATION_REQUIRED` instead of a self-issued discipline verdict.\n- Missing evidence = NOT PROVEN.\n\n## REQUIRED SWEEP\nA. Reconstruct an exact governance matrix for:\n- SHERIFF policy authority on current main;\n- SHERIFF owner-PC runtime state/freshness;\n- scoreboard/verdict durability;\n- PR #252 three-chat candidate;\n- Security R02 #235/#241;\n- active product path #248/#251;\n- night queue #254 durable delivery state.\n\nB. Incident scan:\n- any unsupported PASS/ACTIVE/LOCKED/PRODUCTION claim;\n- any stale state overriding fresher GitHub evidence;\n- any repeated failed route without causal change;\n- any OWNER-as-courier request where tooling could act;\n- any scope expansion beyond the current product blocker;\n- any scheduled/queued work reported as executed without evidence.\n\nC. Product-first arbitration:\nDo not let SHERIFF/process work displace the active product route. Unless fresh evidence supersedes it, the only legal product continuation is:\n`materialize exact frozen MASTER FRONT bytes on existing HOME-PC capable surface -> fresh SHA256 match -> Krita exact-source open/consume proof -> W01 ARM_RAISE ONLY -> output SHA256 + full W01 matrix -> independent QC`.\n\nNo substitute source. No source-recovery reopen. No W02+. No POSE/CAMERA/S001. No new framework/runner/editor.\n\n## MUTATION BOUNDARY\nMERGE = NO\nMAIN_MUTATION = NO\nCANON_MUTATION = NO\nPRODUCTION_MUTATION = NO\nDISCIPLINE_MUTATION = NO until independent verdict evidence exists\n\n## TERMINAL REPORT CONTRACT\nEmit one durable `SHERIFF_PROJECT_INTEGRITY_SWEEP_R01_RESULT` containing:\n- MAIN_HEAD_OBSERVED\n- EVIDENCE_WINDOW\n- GOVERNANCE_MATRIX\n- INCIDENTS (or NONE), each with exact evidence + independence status\n- FALSE_PASS_FINDINGS\n- STALE_STATE_FINDINGS\n- LOOP_FINDINGS\n- PRODUCT_GATE_STATE\n- FIRST_REAL_BLOCKER\n- NEXT_LEGAL_PRODUCT_STEP\n- SECURITY_R02_STATE\n- PR252_STATE\n- SHERIFF_RUNTIME_STATE\n- SHERIFF_POLICY_STATE\n- SCOREBOARD_STATE\n- OWNER_ACTION_REQUIRED = YES/NO with exact reason\n- PASS/FAIL/BLOCKED only where exact evidence supports that scope\n\nDo not close this issue merely because the sweep was scheduled or started.",
